commit.message:
Merge two-card batch default (owner choice a): two NVIDIA cards pipeline by default

Pipelined groups beat the serial default at 2 and 4 streams on 2x A6000 (+17/+22%) and 2x A4000 (+7..12/+17..20%);
one stream equal, -4% on A4000 IQ3_XXS. STRATA_BATCH_GROUPS_NV_SERIAL=1 or STRATA_DEFAULTS=026 gives serial.
